<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="container-fluid m-0"
    style="background-image: url('https://picsum.photos/id/392/500'); background-position:top; background-color: bisque; background-repeat: repeat-y; background-attachment: repeat; background-size: cover;">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/styles/styler.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
</head>

<body class="container-lg col bg-dark-subtle">
    <div>
        <h1 class="text-center text-white p-3 mt-4 mb-4 rounded-3">
            <span aria-label="smiley" role="img">😃 </span>
            APIExpressHub
            <span aria-label="robot" role="img">🤖</span>
        </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="container-fluid text-center p-5 row">
        <h2> Hello, World! Welcome to APIExpressHub <h4>-- This is a basic <a href="https://ejs.co/"
                    class="text-decoration-none">EJS</a> templating
                Web App.</h4>
        </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
        <section id="tips">
            <h3 class="callout-info">Tips to get you started!</h3>
            <ul class="callout-info">
                <li>Use the navigation links below to explore different API functionalities!</li>
                <li>Feel free to check out the source code on <a href="https://github.com/LI-Dev/APIsExpressHub"
                        class="text-decoration-none">GitHub</a></li>
                <li>You only have to click to call a route once, then simply tap the enter
                    button to your preference 😊</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div id="navigationLinks"
        class="container-fluid text-dark p-3 gap-3 flex-row justify-content-center d-flex mt-4 mb-4 rounded-3">
        <h6 class="container-sm border border-success p-3 bg-primary-subtle text-center">Navigate to <a href="/jokes"
                class="text-decoration-none">JokeHub</a> to
            see some funny jokes!</h6>
        <h6 class="container-sm border border-success p-3 bg-primary-subtle text-center">Navigate to <a href="/picgen"
                class="text-decoration-none">PicGen</a> to generate some pictures!</h6>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <h4 class="callout-info text-center p-3">Hope you have a great time exploring the APIs! 😊</h4>
    <hr>

    <footer class="container col text-white p-3 mt-4 mb-4 rounded-3"">

        <div id=" footer" class="container-fluid">
        <h6>Catch me at any of the below endpoints! =)</h6>
        <p>Phone: <a href="callto:+1234567890">+1234567890</a></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:devliops@outlook.com">devliops@outlook.com</a></p>

        <p>Check out my Socials to keep up with the latest developments-
        <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lio-ilu-93/"><img
                        src="https://img.icons8.com/nolan/40/linkedin.png" alt="linkedin" /></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://x.com/IluDev93"><img src="https://img.icons8.com/nolan/40/twitterx.png"
                        alt="twitterx" /></a></li>
            <li></li>
        </ul>
        </div>
        <hr class="container-fluid border-primary-subtle">
        <section id="footer" class="container-lg row">
            <p>&copy; 2025 APIExpressHub</p>
            <p><a href="">Privacy Policy</a></p>
            <h6>A design by <em>DevLI</em> of LI Dev</h6>
        </section>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>